bc_beacon_info.line.4=Effects last 9 seconds plus 2 per pyramid level and refresh every 4 seconds.
bc_grindstone_info.line.2=Custom names are kept. Curses are not removed.
bc_loom_info.line.2=The banner pattern item is not used up.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.0=A name tag must be renamed in an anvil before it can be used on a mob.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.1=A renamed spawn egg spawns a mob with that name.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.2=Names can be up to 30 characters in Bedrock Edition.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.3=Renaming costs 1 level plus any prior-work penalty. A rename-only job costs at most 39 levels.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.4=Leave the name blank to restore the item's default name.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.5=Named items do not stack with unnamed or differently named items.
bc_anvil_guide.nametag.6=Chests, barrels, furnaces, hoppers, shulker boxes, brewing stands and enchanting tables show their name in their screen once placed.
bc_enchanting_guide.desc.enchantment.lunge=A spear jab launches you forward, at the cost of hunger and 1 durability.
